{"schema_version":"1.0","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn11/","title":"해천 EX-HN11","language":"ko-KR","description":"경외기혈 해천의 위치·취혈·자침 정보를 정리합니다.","text":"해천 EX-HN11\n분류\n경외기혈 · 코드 EX-HN11\n위치\n舌下 系帶의 중점.\n취혈\n혀를 위로 말아서 舌系帶 중점의 靜脈部位에서 취혈한다.\n자침·주의\n直刺 0.1～0.2寸\n舌强, 舌苔에는 點刺出血\n임상 연결\n경외기혈은 관련 부위·증상과 14경맥의 경혈을 함께 보고 배혈합니다.\n→ 경외기혈 통합 목록","sections":[{"title":"분류","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn11/#_1","text":"경외기혈 · 코드 EX-HN11","links":[]},{"title":"위치","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn11/#_2","text":"舌下 系帶의 중점.","links":[]},{"title":"취혈","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn11/#_3","text":"혀를 위로 말아서 舌系帶 중점의 靜脈部位에서 취혈한다.","links":[]},{"title":"자침·주의","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn11/#_4","text":"直刺 0.1～0.2寸\n舌强, 舌苔에는 點刺出血","links":[]},{"title":"임상 연결","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn11/#_5","text":"경외기혈은 관련 부위·증상과 14경맥의 경혈을 함께 보고 배혈합니다.\n→ 경외기혈 통합 목록","links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/extra-points/"]}],"headings":[{"level":2,"title":"분류","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn11/#_1"},{"level":2,"title":"위치","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn11/#_2"},{"level":2,"title":"취혈","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn11/#_3"},{"level":2,"title":"자침·주의","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn11/#_4"},{"level":2,"title":"임상 연결","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn11/#_5"}],"links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/extra-points/"],"related_reading":[],"interpretation":"Public article text and navigation only; links do not establish clinical equivalence or treatment recommendations.","provenance":{"document_id":"MSA-7F9F34EBD0848EB4","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/